WEBVTT

00:11.636 --> 00:13.346
My sweet Yeo-ok.

00:15.849 --> 00:17.934
-Oh, God damn, I'm so dizzy.
-Seriously!

00:18.018 --> 00:21.438
-I'm so fucking into that one tall dude!
-It's cold as shit in here.

00:22.272 --> 00:25.233
Seriously, he's so hot.
My fucking God.

00:25.316 --> 00:28.028
What the hell are you saying?

00:28.111 --> 00:29.738
-For real…
-Shit, aren't you cold, guys?

00:29.821 --> 00:32.073
God, just sit there
and stop fucking around.

00:32.574 --> 00:34.784
You know, I…

00:35.827 --> 00:37.996
God, what's with her?

00:38.955 --> 00:41.416
I asked the tall guy out,

00:41.499 --> 00:43.960
but he gave me
the short guy's number instead.

00:45.754 --> 00:49.215
But the short guy
is cute as hell too.

00:49.299 --> 00:52.802
He's small and cute.
Makes you wanna, like, hug him.

00:52.886 --> 00:56.306
-Yeo-ok, would you listen to me? Fuck.
-No…

00:58.892 --> 01:01.478
-There's fumes. Don't.
-Hey. Shut up, bitch.

01:01.561 --> 01:04.314
Stop nagging me, for fuck's sake.

01:04.397 --> 01:05.565
Hey.

01:06.524 --> 01:09.152
Hey! Stop…

01:09.652 --> 01:11.404
Don't fucking light it.

01:27.962 --> 01:29.756
My poor Yeo-ok.

01:35.011 --> 01:36.554
She did nothing wrong.

01:40.433 --> 01:42.102
She was just unlucky.

01:45.230 --> 01:47.440
She just made some bad friends.

02:00.078 --> 02:02.163
That's what my aunt always used to say.

02:04.165 --> 02:05.583
-Well…
-Um…

02:06.084 --> 02:08.044
At least, that's what she believed.

02:10.505 --> 02:12.090
God.

02:13.133 --> 02:14.676
Oh, my head.

02:17.262 --> 02:18.471
Oh, wow.

02:18.555 --> 02:20.265
Honey, don't you smell something?

02:20.974 --> 02:22.350
Come on. Wake up.

02:28.523 --> 02:29.941
What are you…

02:30.024 --> 02:32.360
what are you doing up at this hour?

02:32.443 --> 02:33.903
What's that smell?

02:34.487 --> 02:35.864
Ah shit, Mom.

02:35.947 --> 02:38.241
You just had to ruin everything.

02:39.367 --> 02:40.869
Oh, Yeo-ok…

02:45.707 --> 02:49.169
The police said
she signed her parents up

02:49.252 --> 02:52.213
for eight different
life insurance policies.

02:55.466 --> 02:56.342
Aah.

02:56.426 --> 02:59.637
It wasn't her disability or poverty.

03:00.847 --> 03:02.682
It was her nature and vanity.

03:02.765 --> 03:03.850
Oh.

03:06.853 --> 03:07.729
Mm…

03:07.812 --> 03:11.858
I know a lot of people have been saying
we should give her our condolences,

03:11.941 --> 03:14.068
since she paid the price with her death,

03:14.152 --> 03:16.029
but I have no intention of doing so.

03:17.530 --> 03:21.117
Death is not something
that should exonerate any sin

03:21.201 --> 03:22.660
if it wasn't repented for.

03:23.620 --> 03:27.248
So, please,
don't give her your condolences.

03:28.791 --> 03:31.753
A KILLER PARADOX

03:32.378 --> 03:34.756
MY COUSIN'S SEON YEO-OK
THE BLIND WOMAN WHO KILLED HER PARENTS

03:36.716 --> 03:40.094
STAYING NEUTRAL TILL THIS IS VERIFIED
I HEARD SHE WASN'T QUALIFIED FOR THE DOG

03:40.178 --> 03:41.304
Crazy, right?

03:42.597 --> 03:44.182
I guess karma does exist, huh?

03:46.809 --> 03:48.186
-Hey, Jae-sun.
-Yes?

03:48.269 --> 03:50.230
-Come here a second.
-Why?

03:50.772 --> 03:52.273
There's some detectives here.

03:52.357 --> 03:55.526
Let Ui-seong take care of it
and come with me. Come on. Come on!

04:05.453 --> 04:07.163
Yes. Mm…

04:07.997 --> 04:10.208
I'm the one who wrote that post, sir.

04:11.751 --> 04:12.794
How come?

04:15.797 --> 04:19.050
-Does that make you think I murdered her?
-No, not at all, miss.

04:20.718 --> 04:23.763
We just had some questions
regarding your cousin, that's all.

04:23.846 --> 04:26.349
The, um… the late Ms. Seon Yeo-ok.

04:29.102 --> 04:33.648
-When was the last time you spoke to her?
-We don't… talk at all.

04:35.233 --> 04:37.443
All right, but when did you last see her?

04:38.611 --> 04:40.280
Well, it's been so long,

04:40.989 --> 04:42.407
I really couldn't say.

04:43.741 --> 04:45.368
Could you give a rough estimate?

04:45.451 --> 04:47.453
Like how many years ago it was?

04:54.294 --> 04:56.504
When Yeo-ok was in grade school…

04:58.965 --> 05:01.009
…she poured boiling water on my face.

05:04.220 --> 05:05.972
You know why she did that?

05:06.973 --> 05:09.392
Yeah. I read what you posted.

05:10.018 --> 05:11.936
You touched her things without asking.

05:19.068 --> 05:21.946
No. She just fucking wanted to.

05:23.114 --> 05:26.492
Just a reason to try to kill me,
because she's just…

05:29.954 --> 05:31.998
She was smiling when she did it.

05:33.624 --> 05:37.253
When she poured that boiling water on me,
she was smiling right at me.

05:43.134 --> 05:45.970
If you were me,
would you want to remember her?

05:48.848 --> 05:50.224
You can get back to work.

05:50.308 --> 05:52.518
-Thanks for your time.
-All right, then.

05:52.602 --> 05:54.354
-Have a safe drive back.
-Thanks.

05:56.397 --> 05:59.984
Ah, the service dog we mentioned earlier.

06:00.068 --> 06:02.695
I'll be in contact
if we're able to locate it, okay?

06:02.779 --> 06:03.654
No.

06:04.405 --> 06:05.907
It's none of my business.

06:06.616 --> 06:07.950
It's really okay.

06:14.665 --> 06:16.876
-Lord…
-Congratulations on your new life!

06:16.959 --> 06:19.879
-Yeah, man! Congratulations! Hey!
-Hear, hear!

06:20.963 --> 06:23.257
-You were pretty lucky there, Chung-jin.
-Ah, wow.

06:23.341 --> 06:24.258
Thank you.

06:24.342 --> 06:26.969
I might as well get struck by lightning
on a clear day, huh?

06:27.095 --> 06:28.596
-My man, Chung-jin.
-Yes.

06:28.679 --> 06:30.973
You finally have a badge of honor.
How do you feel?

06:31.057 --> 06:33.393
-Hey, did it hurt bad?
-Ah… Course it hurt. Jesus.

06:33.476 --> 06:36.854
-This is embarrassing, you guys.
-Hey, come on, tell us.

06:36.938 --> 06:39.232
Well, no one here's
been stabbed before, huh?

06:39.315 --> 06:40.775
I almost died last year.

06:40.858 --> 06:43.694
Nah, you were nowhere near death.
I was way closer.

06:43.778 --> 06:47.824
The soju bottle was this big, and then he…
Pfft! Just stabbed me with it.

06:47.907 --> 06:50.701
And you don't even know what's goin' on.

06:51.452 --> 06:54.664
The minute he stabbed me, I thought,
"I ought to catch this asshole," but--

06:54.747 --> 06:56.499
-It's true. I turned.
-Wow. That's stupid.

06:56.582 --> 06:58.334
Then I started gushing.

06:58.418 --> 07:01.212
-Here we go again.
-No, the blood was leaking, I swear.

07:01.295 --> 07:02.839
And that's when I knew.

07:03.339 --> 07:06.634
"Hey, something isn't right.
Something's wrong. This is bizarre."

07:06.717 --> 07:09.637
It felt like the blood from my whole body
was draining out of me.

07:09.720 --> 07:11.347
Pussy.

07:11.431 --> 07:13.933
-Ah, it's not that bad.
-Seriously, guys.

07:14.016 --> 07:16.602
-Ah, you're exaggerating.
-When have you ever gotten knifed?

07:16.686 --> 07:18.646
So who murdered those guys, huh?

07:18.729 --> 07:19.981
No idea.

07:20.064 --> 07:22.400
Ahem. These few days have been hectic.

07:22.483 --> 07:24.193
I know. It's odd.

07:26.279 --> 07:28.114
Uh, anyway, uh…

07:28.197 --> 07:31.033
You should go back to the hospital
and think it over.

07:31.117 --> 07:33.202
Don't you think you'll regret it?

07:33.286 --> 07:37.331
Hmm. Uh… It's not just this incident, uh…

07:37.415 --> 07:40.168
But if I leave it as is,
the doctor says there's a possibility

07:40.251 --> 07:41.752
one day, I'll drop dead.

07:42.503 --> 07:44.672
I'm not cut out to be a detective.

07:44.755 --> 07:48.968
And, with the work I've been doing,
I don't wanna go to the night-shift team.

07:49.051 --> 07:51.429
Hey, listen. Every job's the same.

07:52.472 --> 07:55.850
We all carry a resignation letter
in our hearts. Ahem.

07:55.933 --> 07:57.935
Do you even have a job lined up…

07:58.019 --> 07:59.687
Hey, come on in.

08:00.438 --> 08:01.481
-Mm!
-Here you go.

08:01.564 --> 08:02.565
Hey, thanks.

08:05.276 --> 08:06.486
As I was saying…

08:06.569 --> 08:08.362
Got any plans after you quit?

08:08.446 --> 08:11.782
-You know my wife runs a hair salon?
-Mm.

08:11.866 --> 08:15.870
And for the last three years, we've been
considering moving abroad somewhere.

08:15.953 --> 08:18.122
Uh, we even put the salon up for sale.

08:18.206 --> 08:20.458
-And I have my severance pay.
-Aah.

08:21.000 --> 08:25.546
I can't rely on my wife to make ends meet,
so I'll teach myself how to make sushi.

08:25.630 --> 08:28.591
I'd go by James Park,
or something like that.

08:29.425 --> 08:32.136
Yeah, I've lived away from family.

08:33.554 --> 08:35.848
It's not a great way to live.

08:36.849 --> 08:41.270
I should've gone with them
and become Oliver Park instead.

08:42.188 --> 08:44.357
I feel like I can't even talk to my kids.

08:46.275 --> 08:47.401
Ahem.

08:51.155 --> 08:53.824
My baby was a gentle boy!
He's never harmed anyone!

08:53.908 --> 08:55.451
You know nothing about him!

08:55.535 --> 08:58.246
-Will you catch the killer or not?
-Ma'am, you're obstructing justice.

08:58.329 --> 09:01.582
-Oh, really? I'm obstructing it? Huh?
-Calm down, ma'am. No, you're not.

09:01.666 --> 09:04.919
-Did you catch the murderer?
-I'll call later when you're calmer.

09:05.002 --> 09:07.547
-Would you say that if he was your kid?
-Could somebody escort her?

09:07.630 --> 09:10.424
You might as well have killed
my son again with that autopsy!

09:12.426 --> 09:13.844
Sir, are you all right?

09:14.428 --> 09:16.305
You try getting slapped. Shit.

09:29.610 --> 09:30.778
Aah.

09:36.200 --> 09:38.119
-Hey, sir?
-Hmm?

09:40.371 --> 09:42.790
Thinking about Detective Park
makes me angry too.

09:43.916 --> 09:44.834
And?

09:46.294 --> 09:49.005
Don't you think we were too harsh
on that woman in there?

09:49.088 --> 09:51.215
-What do you mean?
-Well, think it through…

09:51.841 --> 09:52.925
Her kid died.

09:55.011 --> 09:57.263
If I were her, I already would've lost it.

09:57.805 --> 09:59.932
They were murdered.
We don't have evidence or witnesses.

10:00.016 --> 10:02.184
That's not true.
We just haven't found any yet.

10:02.268 --> 10:04.186
There's no murder without evidence.

10:04.270 --> 10:06.731
It's just… that's not
what this is about, sir.

10:09.483 --> 10:10.526
I'm sorry.

10:14.864 --> 10:15.781
Hey…

10:18.868 --> 10:21.704
Victims can also be victimizers.

10:22.288 --> 10:23.164
Mm?

10:24.373 --> 10:25.666
Know what I'm saying?

10:29.420 --> 10:32.131
I worked on a case
at the Dunsan Police Station.

10:44.268 --> 10:46.187
Her name was Kang Yeon-seo.

10:46.270 --> 10:48.147
-What?
-I still can't forget about it.

10:48.230 --> 10:50.691
-What's that?
-I'm drawing your eyebrows.

10:52.234 --> 10:53.527
Can you please just wear makeup?

10:53.611 --> 10:56.822
-I'll try. Fine.
-You look so good with it.

10:56.906 --> 10:58.949
-Huh?
-Hey, that's him.

11:01.202 --> 11:03.079
He looked better in the picture.

11:03.162 --> 11:04.872
This'll look good on him, right?

11:07.291 --> 11:10.586
-What's wrong with her?
-I don't know. She has a crush.

11:10.670 --> 11:12.380
She said he was hot, but he isn't.

11:13.339 --> 11:15.091
What? You didn't have to.

11:15.174 --> 11:16.759
-What?
-How are you?

11:16.842 --> 11:18.135
-Good.
-What's in there?

11:18.219 --> 11:20.221
-What are you doing?
-Hanging out.

11:20.304 --> 11:22.306
-What is it?
-Relax! It's mine!

11:22.390 --> 11:23.974
-I'm not done yet.
-Those your friends?

11:24.058 --> 11:25.184
-Yeah.
-What is it?

11:25.267 --> 11:27.019
-No classes?
-Let me see.

11:27.103 --> 11:28.521
Dude, chill. It's mine.

11:28.604 --> 11:29.772
One, two, three!

11:30.398 --> 11:32.191
Honey, let me get a bigger smile.

11:32.692 --> 11:34.568
-One, two…
-Come on, if you're done.

11:34.652 --> 11:36.904
-A happier one.
-Do I look good?

11:36.987 --> 11:38.406
-Want to see?
-Let me!

11:38.489 --> 11:40.324
-Hold on, dumbass.
-Come on.

11:40.408 --> 11:41.909
-Hold the fuck on.
-Hurry up!

11:41.992 --> 11:45.037
-You just don't know how to wait.
-Hurry, dude!

11:45.121 --> 11:47.790
-So? How was it? Huge tits, right?
-For fuck's sake.

11:47.873 --> 11:49.583
-Her legs are fucking bomb.
-Big, right?

11:49.667 --> 11:51.502
-Holy shit.
-Let's get the fuck out.

11:51.585 --> 11:53.629
-We gotta run.
-I wanna fuck her once more.

11:53.713 --> 11:54.797
Let's go!

12:01.303 --> 12:02.179
Okay.

12:17.987 --> 12:19.864
A month after she was raped,

12:21.031 --> 12:22.575
she took her own life.

12:30.249 --> 12:33.419
-No, you can come by later.
-I just want to talk to him.

12:33.502 --> 12:34.420
KANG YEON-SEO

12:34.503 --> 12:37.840
-You can do that another time.
-Sir! Can I talk to you?

12:37.923 --> 12:41.802
-This is a funeral, so please…
-We have two different stories.

12:41.886 --> 12:43.471
-Sir!
-We can talk at the station.

12:43.554 --> 12:45.765
It's very strange
you keep avoiding me.

12:45.848 --> 12:48.434
-Please, ma'am.
-You never know if it was consensual!

12:48.517 --> 12:50.686
-You don't know!
-You're out of your mind, woman!

12:50.770 --> 12:52.646
Why raise your voice?

12:52.730 --> 12:54.356
What the hell is wrong with you?

12:54.440 --> 12:56.859
What makes you think
you can attack us like this?

12:56.942 --> 12:59.612
-Do you have no conscience?
-How dare you talk to me like that?

12:59.695 --> 13:02.114
-Let's talk outside, ma'am.
-What exactly are you implying?

13:02.198 --> 13:03.741
-Sorry, everyone.
-Everyone.

13:03.824 --> 13:06.076
-Don't just listen to what you've heard.
-Ajumma!

13:06.160 --> 13:08.162
-You can't!
-They're kids, but men and women…

13:08.245 --> 13:09.914
-Anything can happen!
-What? What?

13:09.997 --> 13:11.499
-You tell the cops what?
-Say it again.

13:11.582 --> 13:13.083
-What the fuck did you say?
-Stop it!

13:13.167 --> 13:16.629
-I'm not gonna take this from you!
-What did you say? She came onto him?

13:16.712 --> 13:19.173
-These things can happen!
-You're a bunch of losers.

13:19.256 --> 13:21.133
-How fucking dare you?
-Looking to make a buck--

13:21.217 --> 13:23.803
God damn it! Idiot!

13:23.886 --> 13:25.471
-Something's wrong with you.
-You bastard!

13:25.554 --> 13:27.723
This bitch
came to the girl's funeral

13:27.807 --> 13:30.476
and was accusing the parents
of all sorts of bullshit.

13:30.559 --> 13:32.770
-Not fair!
-It was that woman we saw earlier.

13:32.853 --> 13:34.063
-Not now! Go!
-Hmm.

13:34.146 --> 13:35.648
-This is all crap!
-Someone died.

13:36.565 --> 13:39.318
But her son got off easy
because he was a minor.

13:40.945 --> 13:42.488
That wasn't the end of it.

13:43.739 --> 13:47.326
Those assholes kept on committing
assault, burglary, you name it.

13:50.037 --> 13:52.456
I can't say I know
exactly how her parents feel,

13:54.041 --> 13:57.461
but I know, to them,
those assholes aren't victims at all, hmm?

13:57.545 --> 14:00.172
I would've killed them myself already
if I were them.

14:02.132 --> 14:04.343
People aren't just victims or assailants.

14:05.052 --> 14:06.846
They're all people. That's it.

14:07.721 --> 14:10.307
You think we should go
and visit the girl's parents?

14:11.058 --> 14:11.976
Why?

14:13.602 --> 14:17.106
-They might be the--
-Hey. Were you not at the crime scene?

14:17.606 --> 14:20.901
Huh? Did it look
like a premeditated revenge murder?

14:20.985 --> 14:22.486
It was spontaneous, huh?

14:23.362 --> 14:25.197
Still, though, you never know, and…

14:31.328 --> 14:32.621
Mm…

14:32.705 --> 14:34.498
Yeah, yeah, it was her.

14:34.582 --> 14:36.458
That's her, all right. Yeah, yeah.

14:36.542 --> 14:37.918
She was standing out there.

14:38.002 --> 14:39.837
She was just standing still
and looking around.

14:39.920 --> 14:42.089
Yeesh. I thought she was a ghost.

14:42.172 --> 14:45.342
But then, she didn't come inside the store
or anything, but…

14:45.426 --> 14:47.595
-She just kept looking--
-What time was that?

14:48.637 --> 14:53.309
The night shift was just about to start,
so it was around 10:00 p.m. Ten, yeah.

14:54.894 --> 14:57.771
-You got cameras, right?
-Of course we do.

14:57.855 --> 14:59.440
Look, right over there. Look.

14:59.523 --> 15:02.443
I decided to make an investment
and replaced them with new ones.

15:02.526 --> 15:04.028
The video quality's great.

15:04.653 --> 15:08.198
Although that good quality
also means the files are bigger.

15:08.282 --> 15:10.367
-And it stores--
-So you don't have it?

15:10.868 --> 15:14.830
Well, we have something.
Just nothing older than five days.

15:14.914 --> 15:16.916
We have yesterday's. I can get you that.

15:18.626 --> 15:19.543
Hmm…

15:22.922 --> 15:24.757
What about what's-his-face? Uh…

15:24.840 --> 15:25.716
Who?

15:26.216 --> 15:27.718
Oh, yeah, Lee Tang.

15:28.218 --> 15:29.929
How is he doing these days?

15:30.012 --> 15:32.097
Oh my God, don't even get me started.

15:32.181 --> 15:34.516
Just hearing that asshole's name
gets me angry.

15:34.600 --> 15:37.561
Just, how could he stab me in the back?

15:37.645 --> 15:40.898
My door, the door here,
it doesn't even make the sounds anymore.

15:40.981 --> 15:42.483
He broke this, too, right?

15:42.566 --> 15:44.526
-Yeah.
-What, was he trying to piss me off?

15:44.610 --> 15:46.028
I mean, come on.

15:46.737 --> 15:48.822
I paid him in advance, and he just left.

15:49.406 --> 15:51.033
-Is that right?
-Yeah.

15:51.575 --> 15:53.619
I can't believe that little shit.

15:54.203 --> 15:55.412
Hold on.

15:55.496 --> 15:58.916
Actually, I think he saw her as well, sir.
That lady.

16:00.084 --> 16:03.128
Um, w-well, does that help you at all?

16:03.212 --> 16:05.673
REACH OUT IF YOU NEED HELP
TELEGRAM: T.ME/ONLYFORHEROES

16:05.756 --> 16:08.008
INCOGNITO MODE

16:08.092 --> 16:09.134
PHONE NUMBER

16:11.720 --> 16:13.681
NAME
LEE TANG

16:17.309 --> 16:18.477
LEE TANG

16:21.397 --> 16:22.982
ONLYFORHEROES HAS INVITED YOU

16:26.652 --> 16:27.653
HELLO.

16:29.446 --> 16:32.199
ONLYFORHEROES HAS SET
THE AUTO-DELETE TIMER TO 3 SECONDS

16:32.282 --> 16:33.325
THANKS FOR CONTACTING ME.

16:38.664 --> 16:40.666
NICE TO MEET YOU, MR. LEE TANG

16:45.754 --> 16:46.672
BLOCK USER

16:50.217 --> 16:52.678
Ah, fuck me.

16:58.017 --> 16:59.435
What the--

17:00.519 --> 17:03.272
Hello! Registered mail!

17:06.650 --> 17:08.736
No one's home? Oh, God.

17:11.030 --> 17:13.407
My, my. To what do I owe the honor?

17:13.490 --> 17:16.493
If it isn't Detective Jang,
the busiest man alive.

17:16.577 --> 17:18.203
Why'd you leave so early?

17:18.287 --> 17:20.414
I, uh, got some more things to do

17:20.497 --> 17:21.331
at the hospital.

17:21.832 --> 17:23.834
You didn't even call when I was in there.

17:23.917 --> 17:25.711
So, what's up?

17:25.794 --> 17:27.671
You were only there for two days.

17:28.255 --> 17:30.174
That's just a long doctor's visit.

17:30.799 --> 17:31.925
Huh? Hey.

17:32.760 --> 17:34.094
I just heard you quit.

17:35.387 --> 17:37.389
You can't quit
before you catch the killer.

17:37.473 --> 17:40.059
I found somethin' strange
about Seon Yeo-ok's case.

17:40.142 --> 17:42.269
Mm. But there's still a lot more to do.

17:42.352 --> 17:44.521
Jesus, man, is work
all you ever talk about?

17:44.605 --> 17:46.190
God, you really are a robot.

17:47.399 --> 17:49.943
If the killer just happens
to fall out of thin air,

17:50.027 --> 17:51.612
I'll think about it, okay?

17:51.695 --> 17:54.031
Nothin's gonna fall out of thin air
if you just stay home.

17:54.114 --> 17:55.657
You have to at least do somethin'.

17:55.741 --> 17:58.494
Whatever, I'm hangin' up.
I have to spend time with my family.

17:58.577 --> 18:01.163
Yeah, well,
I'm sure they don't even want you there.

18:01.705 --> 18:03.624
Hey.
Drink lots of water, buddy.

18:03.707 --> 18:06.043
You don't wanna get
kidney stones, all right?

18:06.126 --> 18:07.461
Think about your health.

18:07.544 --> 18:10.297
-Not the damn killer, okay?
-Stop changing the subject and--

18:11.632 --> 18:15.302
-You came home dressed like that?
-I wasn't out that long.

18:15.969 --> 18:18.347
Shouldn't Dong-u be home
from school about now?

18:18.847 --> 18:22.601
-Oh, he went out for a bike ride.
-Ow! Jesus.

18:22.684 --> 18:25.354
-Hey, stop throwing things around. God.
-Ow, shit.

18:25.437 --> 18:27.523
-Jeez.
-Since when does he have a bike?

18:27.606 --> 18:29.566
Oh, didn't Nan-gam tell you?

18:30.150 --> 18:32.569
He sent it to him
as an early birthday present.

18:32.653 --> 18:35.030
-Nan-gam did, really?
-Yeah.

18:36.490 --> 18:38.075
Call him and say thanks.

18:38.158 --> 18:41.745
Uh… why didn't he say
anything to me about that?

18:41.829 --> 18:43.539
That punk-ass. Jesus.

18:50.254 --> 18:52.131
ATTENDANCE REQUEST

18:52.214 --> 18:55.384
YOU ARE BEING SUED
FOR FINANCIAL FRAUD BY MR. JUNG GANG-HYO

18:57.594 --> 18:59.138
Ah, shit.

18:59.221 --> 19:02.432
-Well, he got charged for fraud.
-Mm.

19:02.516 --> 19:04.726
But he's just a part-timer
over there.

19:04.810 --> 19:05.727
That's right.

19:05.811 --> 19:08.730
So, uh, I just told the guy
to file a civil suit,

19:08.814 --> 19:10.399
but then he was quite adamant,

19:10.899 --> 19:14.153
saying I was legally required
to process the case.

19:14.236 --> 19:16.363
So I didn't really have a choice.

19:18.532 --> 19:21.076
So I was gonna
try to help them settle.

19:21.160 --> 19:22.995
The only problem with that, though…

19:23.078 --> 19:25.831
-The kid's gone off the radar.
-Do you have his address?

19:25.914 --> 19:26.957
Let's see…

19:27.040 --> 19:28.750
Address. Just a minute.

19:30.419 --> 19:31.712
-Mm…
-Hmm.

19:31.795 --> 19:35.299
I've sent the attendance request.
That was… When was that?

19:36.800 --> 19:38.719
Yeah, he should've received it today.

19:39.219 --> 19:41.722
-So… What, do you know him?
-Yeah.

19:43.098 --> 19:45.767
If you're able to reach him,
please just let me know.

19:45.851 --> 19:46.810
Sure.

19:50.981 --> 19:53.108
Let me know
if you can't reach him as well.

19:53.942 --> 19:56.528
-Sure. I'll let you know.
-All right. Thank you.

19:58.822 --> 20:00.657
Turn left on this street.

20:04.077 --> 20:06.830
You have arrived at your destination.

20:06.914 --> 20:08.332
Ending navigation.

20:31.980 --> 20:33.857
I should've moved a long time ago.

20:35.609 --> 20:39.863
She hated having her own picture taken,
but she loved taking pictures of others.

20:40.739 --> 20:42.908
She took pictures
of everyone in her class.

20:43.700 --> 20:45.410
-All of 'em.
-May I look at this?

20:45.494 --> 20:46.828
-That okay?
-Yeah, please.

20:50.707 --> 20:54.586
I remember once, I told her
that she should become a photographer.

20:55.921 --> 20:58.090
But she said
she wanted a nine-to-five job.

20:59.007 --> 21:00.842
She wanted to work for some company

21:01.593 --> 21:03.387
and do it as a hobby, so…

21:05.639 --> 21:07.933
And she never really stood out, you know?

21:08.600 --> 21:10.602
She always kept a low profile.

21:12.312 --> 21:14.690
And I'm not saying this
just 'cause I'm her dad.

21:15.399 --> 21:17.109
She was so kindhearted,

21:18.777 --> 21:20.112
and generous too.

21:23.323 --> 21:25.450
And that's why I decided to murder them.

21:28.870 --> 21:29.705
Huh?

21:30.289 --> 21:31.540
I said I killed them.

21:35.002 --> 21:36.545
I'm the one who murdered.

21:37.796 --> 21:39.006
I killed them.

21:39.589 --> 21:40.924
Uh… I killed them.

21:41.008 --> 21:43.302
I killed them.

21:44.177 --> 21:46.763
This is Detective Lee Chang-taek,
Detective Section.

21:47.306 --> 21:49.725
Hi. Hi, uh…

21:50.267 --> 21:51.727
I wanna turn myself in.

21:52.311 --> 21:53.895
You want to turn yourself in?

21:54.813 --> 21:56.982
Uh… what's your name, sir?

21:59.192 --> 22:00.861
L-- Lee Tang.

22:00.944 --> 22:03.280
Oh, Mr. Lee Tang. Hold on.

22:05.407 --> 22:07.284
Okay, uh…

22:08.702 --> 22:11.830
Uh… I guess you received
the attendance request, huh?

22:12.331 --> 22:15.125
This is about you going off the radar
after receiving advance payment

22:15.208 --> 22:16.376
from Mr. Jung Gang-hyo

22:16.460 --> 22:18.170
of OS25 convenience store.

22:18.253 --> 22:20.422
You're under investigation
for that charge.

22:20.505 --> 22:23.842
Come to the Detective Section
at the station on the requested date.

22:24.551 --> 22:25.635
Actually,

22:26.136 --> 22:27.763
do you think I could come today?

22:27.846 --> 22:28.722
Today?

22:29.681 --> 22:31.475
Well, just one minute.

22:33.643 --> 22:35.479
Not seven.

22:35.562 --> 22:36.980
Not eight.

22:37.064 --> 22:38.815
Would 9:00 p.m. be all right?

22:40.400 --> 22:41.234
Yeah.

22:46.531 --> 22:48.325
CONVENIENCE STORE

22:48.408 --> 22:49.368
MOM

23:17.562 --> 23:19.940
So you hit them
with a brick?

23:20.857 --> 23:24.027
-But don't remember what you did with it?
-No.

23:24.611 --> 23:28.782
The two victims were
healthy teenagers, sir.

23:30.033 --> 23:34.371
What, uh, gave you the confidence
that you could take them both on?

23:37.416 --> 23:38.375
They were…

23:39.709 --> 23:41.878
wasted and couldn't even walk straight.

23:43.004 --> 23:44.840
So I thought it was my chance.

23:47.634 --> 23:49.761
And how did you know that they were drunk?

23:49.845 --> 23:54.182
Well, they were…
nearly unconscious, swaying around.

24:10.490 --> 24:12.701
I'm sorry for going off
on my own like that.

24:14.744 --> 24:16.538
You decided to bring him in, then?

24:17.414 --> 24:20.375
You mentioned his probation earlier,
and so, um…

24:20.459 --> 24:23.712
So I looked into it, and his probation
ended the day before the incident.

24:23.795 --> 24:26.339
I thought he might have
been connected to the case,

24:26.423 --> 24:28.675
so I went to go pay him a visit
at his place.

24:30.927 --> 24:34.139
It was all thanks to your guidance, sir.
I appreciate it.

24:38.059 --> 24:40.228
Ah, the boss helped out with all the rest.

24:41.730 --> 24:44.065
Seriously, though,
I was so nervous earlier.

24:44.649 --> 24:46.818
But fortunately,
he confessed to everything.

24:46.902 --> 24:49.237
And it matches the circumstan--

24:56.369 --> 24:58.622
Here you go, sir.

25:00.499 --> 25:02.501
You can take your time and fill it out.

25:13.970 --> 25:17.140
Sir, if you'd like to take a minute,
how about a smoke before we do this?

25:18.099 --> 25:20.352
I quit a long time ago.

25:26.149 --> 25:27.567
So, why did you lie to us?

25:30.570 --> 25:31.488
Uh, what?

25:33.740 --> 25:35.283
You didn't kill them, did you?

25:36.326 --> 25:38.078
I don't know
what you're talking about.

25:38.161 --> 25:40.914
Yeah, I'm sure you don't know,
since you didn't kill them,

25:42.374 --> 25:45.210
but one of the victims
had a cigarette burn on his face.

25:45.293 --> 25:46.253
And one more thing.

25:50.006 --> 25:51.758
You're not right-handed, either.

25:55.428 --> 25:56.429
With me.

26:07.399 --> 26:09.776
-What?
-Hey, why would you go in there alone?

26:09.859 --> 26:11.820
-What the hell are you doing?
-Interrogating him.

26:11.903 --> 26:14.030
You guys went rogue.
Now a man's under arrest.

26:14.114 --> 26:15.198
What should I do?

26:15.282 --> 26:17.951
His statement just doesn't add up.
None of it makes sense.

26:18.034 --> 26:19.202
There's no evidence, either.

26:19.286 --> 26:21.580
-How is a confession enough?
-What do you mean, no evidence?

26:21.663 --> 26:23.832
-There's the brick. He knew about that.
-Come on!

26:23.915 --> 26:25.041
He has motive.

26:25.125 --> 26:28.628
Let's say he confesses and tells you
he threw the brick into the Geum river.

26:28.712 --> 26:32.424
Are you gonna search the bottom
of the river for it? No, right? Mm?

26:32.924 --> 26:35.802
We don't know if he's an abettor,
accomplice, or witness.

26:35.885 --> 26:38.054
So, let's take our time
and figure that out.

26:38.722 --> 26:42.392
We'll all be fucked if the real culprit
shows up. That's why I'm doing this.

26:42.475 --> 26:45.520
-You should have talked to me in private.
-I was just…

26:46.021 --> 26:48.356
-I'm sorry for being rash.
-You think you're so clever.

26:48.440 --> 26:52.193
But do you honestly think he's telling us
the truth about his involvement?

26:52.277 --> 26:55.780
More than likely, he's covering up
something. We need to find out what.

26:55.864 --> 26:57.490
-And you believe that?
-Yes, sir.

26:59.159 --> 27:01.119
All right then, smart-ass.

27:02.412 --> 27:04.581
You think you're so damn clever,
don't you?

27:05.540 --> 27:07.375
If this goes wrong, it's on you.

27:21.389 --> 27:23.975
GOT IN TOUCH WITH THE PART-TIMER
HE'S COMING IN AT 9:00 P. M.

27:24.059 --> 27:25.435
I'm sorry, sir.

27:25.518 --> 27:27.812
I told you to stay in your lane, Yong-jae.

27:29.773 --> 27:30.982
Didn't I?

27:35.528 --> 27:36.863
You can go home now.

27:44.579 --> 27:46.081
What, is your ego damaged?

27:48.500 --> 27:49.793
That's not it, sir.

27:51.628 --> 27:53.088
I have something to tell you.

27:53.963 --> 27:55.173
What?

27:55.256 --> 27:58.385
I contacted the victims' mothers
to let them know we had a suspect.

27:58.468 --> 27:59.469
Which victim?

28:00.220 --> 28:01.721
The dead high schoolers.

28:04.432 --> 28:05.433
Kang Sang-muk?

28:06.351 --> 28:07.519
Did you send him home?

28:08.228 --> 28:09.729
He's already been released.

28:13.733 --> 28:15.402
There won't be a problem, right?

28:21.074 --> 28:23.576
-Let's play, come on.
-Play what?

28:24.494 --> 28:25.578
What do you want?

28:26.204 --> 28:28.790
-Mm, tag!
-Tag? Again?

28:28.873 --> 28:30.583
Really?

28:30.667 --> 28:31.918
Yeah?

29:10.623 --> 29:13.042
Damn. You've got my respect.
You're gangster, bro.

29:13.126 --> 29:14.127
My ass, idiot.

29:14.210 --> 29:16.045
I can't believe
you stabbed that cop.

29:16.129 --> 29:18.673
He was pissing me off.
The fuck was I supposed to do?

29:18.757 --> 29:21.092
You hit a guy
with a fire extinguisher that time.

29:21.176 --> 29:22.719
Insane.

29:22.802 --> 29:25.346
Fuck's sake, I don't talk
about that. It was an accident.

29:25.430 --> 29:27.390
The fire extinguisher just fell on him…

29:33.521 --> 29:37.275
I said he was getting on
my fucking nerves. I had to do something.

29:37.358 --> 29:38.777
Why'd you do it?

29:38.860 --> 29:41.446
JUST DO AS YOU PRACTICED
I'LL TAKE CARE OF THE REST

29:42.280 --> 29:45.033
Shut the fuck up, dude.
You're such a dumbass.

29:45.533 --> 29:46.993
You're the dumbass.

29:48.077 --> 29:49.412
Whatever.

29:49.496 --> 29:52.248
Seriously, bro…
use your fucking head.

29:52.332 --> 29:55.126
Shit, will you stop
fucking giving me shit? Fuck, bro.

29:55.210 --> 29:56.795
I'm gonna stab you, fucker.

29:56.878 --> 30:00.423
-Right. Like to see you try.
-I'll cut your nuts off, bitch.

30:39.337 --> 30:41.130
Are you okay? Sir!

30:41.214 --> 30:43.258
-Wake up!
-Ah, shit.

30:43.341 --> 30:44.801
-Call an ambulance!
-Oh, God.

30:44.884 --> 30:46.094
He needs help!

30:48.012 --> 30:49.556
Sir, wake up.

30:49.639 --> 30:51.516
-Can you hear me?
-Open the door!

30:51.599 --> 30:53.101
-He conscious?
-Wake up!

30:53.184 --> 30:54.936
-Open it.
-A man hit by a car.

30:55.019 --> 30:56.855
-Come quick.
-His eyes are opening.

30:56.938 --> 30:58.523
-Sir, are you okay?
-He's up.

30:58.606 --> 31:01.568
-They hit him with a car?
-Ma'am. Open the door.

31:03.903 --> 31:05.488
…and press confirm.

31:09.117 --> 31:10.702
Please insert your bills.

31:12.412 --> 31:14.205
CONVENIENCE STORE

31:14.289 --> 31:15.498
MOM

31:24.424 --> 31:27.010
Please insert your bills
and press confirm.

31:35.059 --> 31:38.187
Thank you for using our services.

31:51.993 --> 31:53.953
Oh, my God! What--

31:59.834 --> 32:02.128
Are you okay? Call 911.

32:11.220 --> 32:12.221
Ugh.

32:17.769 --> 32:19.020
What the fuck is this?

32:19.562 --> 32:20.980
What? Let me see.

32:24.984 --> 32:26.027
There's money.

32:29.781 --> 32:30.823
What about the rest?

32:31.407 --> 32:33.201
Just throw it away. What else?

32:33.743 --> 32:34.661
Let's go!

32:51.094 --> 32:53.012
You were robbed by a snatch thief?

32:53.096 --> 32:54.931
-That correct?
-Yeah.

32:55.974 --> 32:58.685
Can't believe
that still happens these days.

33:04.524 --> 33:05.608
Exactly.

33:08.111 --> 33:11.447
Son of a bitch, man.
What are the odds, huh?

33:20.748 --> 33:22.250
Hey, watch your head, sir.

33:28.423 --> 33:31.467
Just press the call button if you need
assistance with anything.

33:31.551 --> 33:32.552
-Okay?
-Okay.

33:43.730 --> 33:46.315
We should have seen you out
earlier at the station.

33:52.864 --> 33:54.699
I guess all parents are the same.

33:56.534 --> 33:58.119
Well, from what I can tell.

33:58.995 --> 34:00.496
What are you trying to say?

34:02.498 --> 34:05.126
There must be a reason
you're going to these lengths.

34:10.465 --> 34:12.175
Is it that you know the killer?

34:13.718 --> 34:15.011
I'm the killer.

34:16.929 --> 34:19.682
It's not revenge
if it's a crime you didn't commit.

34:19.766 --> 34:21.017
It wasn't revenge.

34:22.435 --> 34:24.270
I murdered them 'cause they had it coming.

34:25.521 --> 34:27.190
Those bastards.

34:27.273 --> 34:28.691
They got what they deserved.

34:29.484 --> 34:32.403
It felt great, like a weight was lifted.

34:33.738 --> 34:36.491
-Those assholes deserved to die.
-Sir.

34:39.202 --> 34:41.162
I understand that sometimes,

34:41.245 --> 34:44.040
things happen that can make
you want to murder somebody.

34:44.957 --> 34:46.626
But the punishment isn't yours to give

34:46.709 --> 34:49.629
and should be carried out
within the boundaries of the law.

34:51.047 --> 34:52.090
That's my opinion.

34:55.051 --> 34:56.344
I'll come by tomorrow.

35:10.650 --> 35:12.110
Let's try moving your arm.

35:12.985 --> 35:13.986
Is that okay?

35:14.904 --> 35:16.781
-Yeah.
-Hold it in place for a moment.

35:16.864 --> 35:18.116
I'll tape it up for you.

35:18.699 --> 35:20.368
-It's stuffy in there, isn't it?
-It's okay.

35:20.952 --> 35:24.789
-Uh, I think I can go alone now.
-Yeah? You can manage on your own?

35:24.872 --> 35:27.583
-Yes. I appreciate it.
-I'll see you soon, then.

35:27.667 --> 35:29.210
-Thanks.
-…to Radiology.

35:29.752 --> 35:31.754
Dr. Ha-yoon to Radiology.

35:48.855 --> 35:51.816
IF THAT'S WHAT YOU WANT,
I WILL RESPECT YOUR DECISION.

35:51.899 --> 35:53.401
AUTO-DELETE TIMER SET TO 3 SECONDS.

36:03.953 --> 36:05.204
Excuse me.

37:16.776 --> 37:18.277
Hey, are you okay?

37:18.361 --> 37:20.738
You can't be here. Get outta here.

37:20.821 --> 37:21.948
-What?
-Listen.

37:22.448 --> 37:23.824
The police are here now.

37:23.908 --> 37:25.868
You need to leave, fast. Hurry.

37:29.247 --> 37:30.998
-You know me?
-Shut up!

37:31.082 --> 37:32.166
Go now.

37:33.542 --> 37:35.336
-You know me, huh?
-Hurry up and go.

37:37.255 --> 37:40.007
Are you that guy from Telegram?

37:40.091 --> 37:42.760
I have a lot to explain. Check Telegram.

37:42.843 --> 37:44.470
-Okay?
-Um, wait, you are.

37:44.553 --> 37:47.974
-You're the one who took me home.
-There are too many eyes on us here.

37:48.057 --> 37:50.518
-Please, just go. Please get outta here.
-Sir.

37:51.143 --> 37:52.895
I don't care what happens anymore.

37:52.979 --> 37:53.938
I swear.

37:54.021 --> 37:57.650
But why did you do it? Have you been
following me around all this time?

37:57.733 --> 37:59.694
-No. You need to go.
-Wait!

37:59.777 --> 38:02.863
-You sent those guys on the motorcycle?
-Wh-what do you mean?

38:02.947 --> 38:04.532
No. No, no, no, that wasn't me.

38:04.615 --> 38:08.577
Anyway, there's so many things
that I need to tell you about.

38:09.078 --> 38:11.414
You'll learn everything on Telegram.
Leave now.

38:12.248 --> 38:13.374
Go!

38:14.875 --> 38:16.794
Thank you so much.

38:18.087 --> 38:19.922
Sure.

38:27.263 --> 38:28.347
Oh!

38:28.431 --> 38:29.557
Oh! Oh, sir!

38:30.599 --> 38:32.310
-Oh, God.
-Are you okay?

38:32.393 --> 38:33.394
Yeah, yeah.

38:36.856 --> 38:39.150
-I'm sorry.
-Jesus, you didn't do anything wrong.

38:39.233 --> 38:40.192
Stop saying that.

38:41.485 --> 38:43.112
You're just a newbie, all right?

38:53.372 --> 38:56.292
And it's not like
your reasoning was totally wrong either.

38:57.585 --> 39:00.755
You were just trying your best
to catch the killer, that's all.

39:03.215 --> 39:05.259
Try not to stress out too much, okay?

39:22.068 --> 39:23.235
Where you going?

39:30.618 --> 39:32.495
-Hello?
-Hey, did Lee Tang come in today?

39:32.578 --> 39:34.455
-No, he hasn't come yet.
-He hasn't?

39:34.538 --> 39:36.624
-I'll wait a little longer.
-Okay, thanks.

39:38.292 --> 39:40.419
Tell me. What did you do wrong?

39:40.503 --> 39:41.587
I…

39:44.632 --> 39:46.384
Tell me.

39:46.467 --> 39:48.135
-Dad.
-I didn't…

39:48.636 --> 39:50.429
-It's so loud.
-You didn't what?

39:51.055 --> 39:53.766
-Lower the volume or turn it off.
-Okay. I'm sorry, Yeon-seo.

39:53.849 --> 39:55.267
You're still up?

39:56.519 --> 39:58.437
And you should quit smoking too.

39:58.938 --> 40:00.022
Look at your face.

40:00.106 --> 40:03.526
Okay. I'll make sure to quit, I promise.

40:03.609 --> 40:05.277
Do you want something to eat?

40:05.903 --> 40:08.030
-Hmm?
-You still need those pills, Dad?

40:08.114 --> 40:09.490
Uh…

40:09.573 --> 40:11.951
Oh, no, I'm… I'm doing okay.

41:35.159 --> 41:36.952
Damn it! You motherfucker.

41:39.830 --> 41:41.624
Ah, fucking…

41:42.791 --> 41:44.210
You piece of shit!

41:45.753 --> 41:47.713
You fucking asshole,
you piece of shit!

41:48.672 --> 41:50.216
Come here, you son of a bitch!

41:50.883 --> 41:51.759
Fuck.

42:06.690 --> 42:07.650
Shit…

42:09.527 --> 42:11.695
Get over here, you little bitch.

42:15.824 --> 42:16.951
Motherfucker!

42:29.922 --> 42:30.965
You fucker!

42:33.300 --> 42:34.760
Fucking son of a bitch!

42:42.434 --> 42:43.852
You motherfucker!

43:30.274 --> 43:31.859
-Yeah, who's this?
-Detective.

43:31.942 --> 43:33.944
I'm the nurse in charge
of Mr. Kang Sang-muk.

43:34.028 --> 43:35.571
-Kang Sang-muk?
-Yes.

43:35.654 --> 43:38.115
-I think you should hurry over here.
-Huh?

43:50.919 --> 43:53.130
The treatment room is this way, over here.

43:53.213 --> 43:55.799
We have to do a blood test
to check his liver and heart.

43:56.300 --> 43:57.343
Checking vitals.

43:57.426 --> 43:59.637
-How's it looking?
-130 over 90.

43:59.720 --> 44:01.555
Come on, let's hurry.

44:01.639 --> 44:03.140
Sir, please wake up.

44:03.641 --> 44:05.768
Sir. Sir, can you hear me?

44:06.352 --> 44:09.104
-Code red.
-Come on, sir, hang on.

44:14.735 --> 44:15.986
TELEGRAM

44:16.070 --> 44:17.279
DELETED ACCOUNT

44:20.115 --> 44:21.825
DELETED ACCOUNT

44:24.745 --> 44:25.663
Hero.

44:57.653 --> 44:58.654
Lee Tang!

44:59.488 --> 45:02.032
You don't wanna bother
the neighbors. Not so loud.

45:02.116 --> 45:03.826
I know you're in there. Come on.

45:05.327 --> 45:08.747
I won't get angry, so please let us in.
Mom's here too.

45:15.796 --> 45:18.006
-There you go. Go ahead.
-Thank you, sir.

45:22.720 --> 45:24.304
Oh my gosh, Yeong…

45:25.180 --> 45:26.849
Would you look at this?

45:26.932 --> 45:29.226
Oh my lord. This place…

45:29.852 --> 45:31.562
Oh…

45:32.062 --> 45:32.938
Oh…

45:34.648 --> 45:35.941
What's this say?

45:36.024 --> 45:38.819
Mom, we should call
Gyeong-hwan again.

45:38.902 --> 45:41.405
Read this for me.
It looks like he left a letter.

45:43.615 --> 45:45.534
"Dear Mom and Dad."

45:50.205 --> 45:52.124
You know which floor she jumped from?

45:52.875 --> 45:54.251
It was the sixth floor.

45:55.794 --> 45:57.588
She jumped from there…

45:59.590 --> 46:01.216
but didn't die right away.

46:03.594 --> 46:05.846
We got her… to the hospital.

46:06.930 --> 46:08.766
And then she suffered

46:09.641 --> 46:11.435
16 hours, till she died.

46:12.311 --> 46:13.353
And it's…

46:13.854 --> 46:14.897
it's all my…

46:16.857 --> 46:18.275
it's all my fault.

46:21.111 --> 46:24.323
Yeon-seo died unavenged, and in anguish.

46:26.200 --> 46:28.452
I was a terrible father to her, as well.

46:34.249 --> 46:35.334
But…

46:35.918 --> 46:38.045
Why am I telling you this? We just met.

46:51.850 --> 46:53.352
Those bastards…

46:56.188 --> 46:57.981
they raped my daughter.

46:59.817 --> 47:01.443
I wish I could kill them.

47:02.110 --> 47:03.445
If I could, I would.

47:05.864 --> 47:06.782
But now

47:07.574 --> 47:09.034
there's nothing I can do.

47:09.618 --> 47:10.536
Sir.

47:11.119 --> 47:12.579
I'm sorry to interrupt.

47:13.330 --> 47:15.457
But there might be something you can do.

47:16.041 --> 47:17.000
Huh?
